-Date: Sun, 5 Feb 2017 17:55:53 +0100
-Subject: [PATCH] rt2x00: mt7620: introduce accessors for CHIP_VER register
-
-The vendor driver behaves differently depending on the package, version
-and ECO revision the MT7620 CHIP_VER register reports. Add
-hw_get_chippkg, hw_get_chipver and hw_get_chipeco to struct rt2800_ops
-so that rt2800lib can query those values. Only rt2800soc implements
-them, and only when built for MT7620; every other bus driver returns 0.
-
-Signed-off-by: Daniel Golle <daniel@makrotopia.org>
