-frames sent via wmediumd, keep them in the driver data of the frame
-until the status arrives. An all-zero A1 marks a frame without rewrite.
-
-[Backports 7.2 has no link ID in the TX status, so this goes without the
-patch that reports it, and the driver data of a frame holds no link ID.]
-
