-From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
-Date: Sun, 27 Sep 2026 22:00:00 +0200
-Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211_hwsim: declare the MLD capabilities of a station
-
-An MLO radio declares extended capabilities, EML capabilities and MLD
-capabilities for the AP interface type only. A station interface of the
-same radio then reports no simultaneous links, and userspace that reads
-the station's MLD capabilities from the wiphy describes an MLO station
-as supporting no simultaneous transmit and receive.
