-capabilities of the AP entry except the TWT responder bit and the same
-maximum number of simultaneous links, and no EML capabilities.
-
-ieee80211_add_ml_elem() takes the MLD Capabilities of the Association
-Request from this entry, so an MLO station of hwsim now announces that
-maximum number of simultaneous links instead of 0.
-
-Signed-off-by: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
