-From: Felix Fietkau <nbd@nbd.name>
-Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 10:30:00 +0200
-Subject: [PATCH] wifi: mac80211_hwsim: make the interface limit of a radio a parameter
-
-A radio combines up to 2048 interfaces of the station, AP, mesh and P2P
-types, far more than hardware does. Userspace that derives the number of
-BSSes a radio supports from the interface combinations then reports a
-value no real radio has.
